sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant A as Authorizer
    participant H as apiHandler
    participant S as S3
    participant D as DynamoDB
    participant P as documentProcessor

    C->>G: POST /documents (X-Api-Key, base64 file)
    G->>A: authorize
    A->>D: GetItem api-keys
    D-->>A: key found
    A-->>G: Allow, userId
    G->>H: invoke
    H->>S: PutObject documents/<id>/<file>
    H->>D: PutItem status=UPLOADED
    H-->>C: 201 {documentId}
    S-)P: ObjectCreated event
    P->>S: HeadObject (metadata)
    P->>D: UpdateItem status=PROCESSED
    C->>G: GET /documents/{id}
    G->>H: invoke
    H->>D: Query documentId
    H-->>C: 200 {status: PROCESSED}
